==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Ninetales|25}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion.
*'''Scorching Breath''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Evolutions|Arcanine|18}} from the {{TCG|Evolutions}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

